{
  "an2.118:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 2.118–129 ",
  "an2.118:0.2": "The Chapter on Hopes That Are Hard to Give Up ",
  "an2.118:1.0": "118 ",
  "an2.118:1.1": "“These two hopes are hard to give up. ",
  "an2.118:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.118:1.3": "The hope for wealth and the hope for long life. ",
  "an2.118:1.4": "These are two hopes that are hard to give up.” ",
  "an2.119:1.0": "119 ",
  "an2.119:1.1": "“These two individuals are rare in the world. ",
  "an2.119:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.119:1.3": "One who takes the initiative, and one who is grateful and thankful. ",
  "an2.119:1.4": "These are the two individuals who are rare in the world.” ",
  "an2.120:1.0": "120 ",
  "an2.120:1.1": "“These two individuals are rare in the world. ",
  "an2.120:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.120:1.3": "One who is satisfied, and one who satisfies others. ",
  "an2.120:1.4": "These are the two individuals who are rare in the world.” ",
  "an2.121:1.0": "121 ",
  "an2.121:1.1": "“These two individuals are hard to satisfy in the world. ",
  "an2.121:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.121:1.3": "One who continually hoards wealth, and one who continually wastes wealth. ",
  "an2.121:1.4": "These are the two individuals who are hard to satisfy in the world.” ",
  "an2.122:1.0": "122 ",
  "an2.122:1.1": "“These two individuals are easy to satisfy in the world. ",
  "an2.122:1.2": "What two? ",
  "an2.122:1.3": "One who does not continually hoard wealth, and one who does not continually waste wealth. ",
  "an2.122:1.4